From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: alioth-droidspaces
Date: Thu, 16 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] gsi: drop __packed from helper return type for genksyms

genksyms cannot parse __packed in a function return type, so the CRC
for gsi_write_channel_scratch is never generated ("version generation
failed") and ld.lld later errors out with:
  relocation R_AARCH64_ABS32 cannot be used against symbol
  __crc_gsi_write_channel_scratch
BFD ld silently accepts the broken entry. Fix the source spelling
instead (return type only; parameter and locals untouched).

Reported upstream in MiCode/Xiaomi_Kernel_OpenSource#5382 and #6922.
---
 drivers/platform/msm/gsi/gsi.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/platform/msm/gsi/gsi.c b/drivers/platform/msm/gsi/gsi.c
--- a/drivers/platform/msm/gsi/gsi.c
+++ b/drivers/platform/msm/gsi/gsi.c
@@ -2651,7 +2651,7 @@
 			gsi_ctx->per.ee));
 }

-static union __packed gsi_channel_scratch __gsi_update_mhi_channel_scratch(
+static union gsi_channel_scratch __gsi_update_mhi_channel_scratch(
 	unsigned long chan_hdl, struct __packed gsi_mhi_channel_scratch mscr)
 {
 	union __packed gsi_channel_scratch scr;
